er&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1ee633a5f9ed31ab00bf55258529a1ea 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marico_w/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9980d674/uploads/origins/45885f1d-a217-40a3-b095-748726eaa41e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8870ddc6e9939bf581bff1d6711e9a25", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9980d674/uploads/origins/45885f1d-a217-40a3-b095-748726eaa41e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8870ddc6e9939bf581bff1d6711e9a25, https://si.imgix.net/9980d674/uploads/origins/45885f1d-a217-40a3-b095-748726eaa41e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb1bd7fe2551c9daa84783665116e5b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9980d674/uploads/origins/45885f1d-a217-40a3-b095-748726eaa41e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ef7862cb79f93752afbb40eef1eb030 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！楽しそうにお喋りをしているガイノイドTalkのflowerをお願いします。目はウインクしている感じで、全身姿を描いていただきたいです！その他背景等はEMU様におまかせします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marico_w/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f628f5/uploads/origins/c6031202-9e38-4304-a894-85d708bd9781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a027075da9717829e308684f355a7ae", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f628f5/uploads/origins/c6031202-9e38-4304-a894-85d708bd9781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8a027075da9717829e308684f355a7ae, https://si.imgix.net/f7f628f5/uploads/origins/c6031202-9e38-4304-a894-85d708bd9781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94e66e6701cbff3ef3d5213d1469ad05 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7f628f5/uploads/origins/c6031202-9e38-4304-a894-85d708bd9781?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e90c03b3f7be98e71aae1085e97b97b1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "キャラクターは、flower(V4のバージョン)で、コンデンサーマイクを持ってステージに立ち、歌っている姿。口元はなるべく見えない(マイクに隠れている)ようにして、真っ直ぐ前を向いた強い瞳である雰囲気でお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marico_w/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/418b3ff7/requests/229656_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57c1836a01d2199b234838d1d68bff19", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/418b3ff7/requests/229656_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57c1836a01d2199b234838d1d68bff19, https://si.imgix.net/418b3ff7/requests/229656_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebdd2096ee2198cdb8071a4251e40b29 2x, https://si.imgix.net/418b3ff7/requests/229656_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03250f7f83319cca57e3e4b7b331ef4d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nIf you have the time, I would love to see you draw a very energetic v4 flower on a stage! Would you be able to do something like this for me?\nI’m a really big fan of your work! Thank you so much!!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@marico_w/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5254c4a/requests/210365_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fbd41c276ae65207e7579a17e24ae34", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c5254c4a/requests/210365_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9fbd41c276ae65207e7579a17e24ae34, https://si.imgix.net/c5254c4a/requests/210365_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42bf14b73c244bf5bcacf7b98e820636 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c5254c4a/requests/210365_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f1c2bad1cc67e527d258156c5f6bc0b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "앉아 v4 flower 뒤에서 껴안고있는 유즈키 유카리 이완을 그립